All 16 finite quadratic discriminant modules with g,s action
are isomorphic to the V10 one.
The V10 E-side anti-isometric graph therefore transports to
each saved N witness at the finite discriminant-module level.
This does NOT prove integral equivalence of the 16 N-actions
or L-actions, root/saturation conditions, or completeness across
other global Hermitian classes. COMPLETED
